Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.85,0:22:09.81,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}努力地抗拒着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.81,0:22:11.31,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}可无论如何  不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.31,0:22:13.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}最终还是会败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.23,0:22:16.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\t(1000,2200,\cC22331)}如果现在能重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:20.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}愿望如梦般短暂 {\fn\fscx\fscy}Rollin’
